@GitHub in Slack and Teams reached GA Nov. 6: investigate a bug and propose a PR from chat. Try one test-repo bug; review the diff and test before merging.
Our Tech Thursday CLI image batch missed the creative bar: AI workflows still need human acceptance. Source: https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-06-github-copilot-in-slack-and-teams-is-generally-available/
Follow Layer8Culture if you're building with AI.
